- General
    - notifications like "Incident be84346d-2942-5ae8-ac3c-7cc775fe4688 promoted to watchlist." should not be persistent and disappear after a few seconds

- Overview tab
    - KPI catalog needs to be human readable

- Incident tab
    - remove bar graph
    - corroborate and reject buttons greyed out for all user roles
    - user should also be able to enter records manually

- Event tab
    - replace bar graph with world map
    - user should also be able to enter records manually
    - dont need confidence score in table
    - in event detail, topics cannot be a raw list format, make it human readable.
    - in the table of participants there should be a button that is called "Enrich Target" that uses the email candidate generator and passes it to email verifyer and returns the valid email to the contact enrichment queue. in the enrichment queue it should also show where that contact came from (from global incidents, global events, inputted manually) if it is inputted manually it should also state who inputted it for the audit/governance trail


- Meeting tab
    -in meeting detail: prep packet, atendees needs to be human readable and not raw json

- Sequences tab
    - table does not have human readable values e.g 26e7feb1-fa8e-539a-9797-0aa21a3bb8c8
        - it should be the name of the prospect and other relevant information
    - pause reason on the table is "Sprint 12 dashboard cancel action." the way it should work is once pause is clicked a popup message comes up where the user can type the reason in and then one button to confirm changes (this is when the sequence is actually paused) and a cancel button. the sequence should only be paused if the user clicks confirm on the popup not before. 
    - every entry in the sequence state table should be able to be opened where the information on the sequencing workflow is shown (e.g send email -> wait two days -> follow up email ->...) 